e, making Dhuleva Group a reliable name in Mumbai’s real estate landscape.","score":0.7266426767651017,"raw_content":null,"id":"cd2a5b-04"},{"url":"https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/new/seven-dhuleva-project-malabar-hill-mumbai/1574","title":"Seven Dhuleva | Luxury Apartments in Malabar Hill","content":"Own premium residences at Seven Dhuleva. Explore luxury amenities, spacious layouts, latest pricing and exclusive launch offers.","score":0.6682658182490278,"raw_content":null,"id":"a01684-05"},{"url":"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DcFzv8co3h1","title":"Dhuleva 232, where your emotions shape our homes ... - Instagram","content":"Amenities in Project - Swimming Pool. Gymnasium. Terrace Garden. Sauna. Steam. Jacuzzi. Multi Purpose Hall. Kids Play Area.","score":0.6628858469059518,"raw_content":null,"id":"5b23b4-06"},{"url":"https://www.beyondwalls.com/property/mumbai/charni-road/dhuleva-one50","title":"Dhuleva One50 - Charni Road - BeyondWalls","content":"Amenities · Parking · Water Supply · Intercom System · Rainwater Harvesting · Security System · Visitor Parking · Power Backup · Sewage Treatment Plant","score":0.6628858469059518,"raw_content":null,"id":"6d1f78-07"}],"response_time":4.72,"request_id":"ce9273df-3f02-4631-9074-1448499c1785"}